<title>FRANCE: Coflexip Stena Q1 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Coflexip Stena Q1 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS, France 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(amounts in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>				    Three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>					  1997	1997	1996</p>
<p>					   USD	FRF	 FRF</p>
<p>    Net operating revenues	 262     1,470	 912</p>
<p>    Operating income (loss)	13	  76	 (30)</p>
<p>    Net financial expense	  (5)	(29)	(41)</p>
<p>Income (loss) before income taxes</p>
<p>					    7	  39	 (71)</p>
<p>    Net income (loss)		 1	   5	 (59)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per share (b)</p>
<p>					 0.07	0.41     (3.57)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Coflexip Stena Offshore.</p>
<p>Coflexip Stena U.S. dollar amounts are provided at the rate of 5.6165 French francs per dollar.</p>
<p>In the first-quarter of 1996, the company recorded a loss of $0.64 per share, compared with a profit of $0.07 for the same period of 1997.</p>
<p>An increase in net operating revenues for the first quarter of 1997 was attributed to the early start of the North Sea season and to the impact of a large contract in the company's Rest of the World zone, partially offset by a decline in Asia Pacific.</p>
</text>
